<title>SWEDEN: TABLE - Stora H1 sales/profit by unit.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Stora H1 sales/profit by unit.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-08-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry group Stora on Tuesday posted these six-month figures for its business areas.</p>
<p>  ------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>			   Net Sales	   Operating Profit</p>
<p> (million crowns)   H1 1997   H1 1996    H1 1997    H1 1996</p>
<p>  ------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>  Power		  879	  824	 177	   -3</p>
<p>  Forest	     3,026	2,897	 419	  300</p>
<p>  Sawn timber	  891	  691	  32	  -54</p>
<p>  Pulp		 2.281	2,230	-238	 -427</p>
<p>  Eliminations    -1,330     -1,173	   -	    -</p>
<p> BASE PRODUCTS     5,747	5,469	 390	 -184</p>
<p>  Printing papers  6,814	7,382	 619	1,528</p>
<p>Technical office</p>
<p>  papers	     1,042	  982	  24	  -78</p>
<p>  Fine papers	4,004	3,812	 452	  103</p>
<p>  Wholesale ops    2,920	3,193	  47	   34</p>
<p>  Eliminations	-870     -1,044	   -	    -</p>
<p> GRAPHIC PAPERS   13,910     14,325     1,142	1,587</p>
<p>Board, packaging</p>
<p>  papers	     4,730	4,725	 256	  603</p>
<p>  Financial ops	-	    -	   311	  115</p>
<p>  Divested units     -	  1,721	   -	  -67</p>
<p>  Nonrecurring items -	    -	  -150	   71</p>
<p>Amortisation of</p>
<p>  surplus values     -	    -	  -178	 -180</p>
<p>  Other	     -2,364     -2,199	-160	  -62</p>
<p> TOTAL		22,203     24,041     1,611	1,883</p>
<p>-- Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
